This copy adds a file-tree context menu, path copying, and local macOS Finder
and Trash actions. Changes to main.js register the row menu, dispatch the
overlay views, and remove missing folders from the expanded tree. The icon
paths use mods/files-panel. file-actions.js is new.

The four copied icons add accessible titles. Their geometry is unchanged.
Their ISC and MIT notices are retained in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.
